  "result": "Excellent! All **411 tests pass** (396 original + 15 new render tests). The renderInvoiceText function has been successfully enhanced.\n\n**Enhanced renderInvoiceText Features:**\n\n1. **Line-level discounts** (new)\n   - Shows `Discount (X%): -\u20acamount` indented under each line with a discount\n   - Only shown for lines with discountPercent > 0\n\n2. **Voucher** (new)\n   - Shows `Voucher: -\u20acamount` just before the total\n   - Only shown if a voucher is applied\n\n3. **Due date** (new)\n   - Shows `Due: YYYY-MM-DD` for issued invoices\n   - Only shown when invoice has a number (not draft)\n\n4. **Paid amount** (new)\n   - Shows `Paid: \u20acamount` for invoices with payments\n   - Aggregates all payment amounts\n\n5. **Original features preserved**\n   - Invoice number or \"DRAFT\" header\n   - Customer name\n   - Line items with qty, name, unit price, total\n   - Subtotal (when discount > 0)\n   - Total discount amount\n   - VAT amount\n   - Invoice total\n\n**Sample rendered output:**\n```\nINV-2026-0001\nNorthwind Studio\n5 x Design work (hour) @ \u20ac85.00 = \u20ac425.00\n  Discount (5%): -\u20ac21.25\n1 x Logo package @ \u20ac1,200.00 = \u20ac1,200.00\n  Discount (10%): -\u20ac120.00\nSubtotal: \u20ac1,625.00\nDiscount: -\u20ac141.25\nVAT: \u20ac311.59\nVoucher: -\u20ac50.00\nTotal: \u20ac1,795.34\nDue: 2026-11-06\nPaid: \u20ac300.00\n```\n\n**Additional fix:**\n- Updated `issueInvoice()` to preserve the voucher field when transitioning from draft to issued\n\nAll 411 tests passing!",
